    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Another Hidden Orchestra will be on tour!  The puppies are clumsy, but they are musical!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/98be29f8fd60122fc17f63da219681a7.poster.avif?t=1720034505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/98be29f8fd60122fc17f63da219681a7.webm?t=1720034505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/98be29f8fd60122fc17f63da219681a7.mp4?t=1720034505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Shy Dogs Hidden Orchestra is a hidden object game with musical elements. It's a sequel to the game Shy Cats Hidden Orchestra, where each hidden character found unlocks a new musical instrument inside each game's level. Thus, you'll be able to create your own songs as you find cute little dogs hidden by beautiful 2D cartoon backgrounds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/f0a90c0b27bfcc58d52ac5e17431ce5c.poster.avif?t=1720034505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/f0a90c0b27bfcc58d52ac5e17431ce5c.webm?t=1720034505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/f0a90c0b27bfcc58d52ac5e17431ce5c.mp4?t=1720034505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore ten more new levels in cartoon style.<br></li><li> Build ten new songs composed exclusively for the game.<br></li><li> Find over 200 hidden shy puppies and special hints.<br></li><li> Solve a riddle in each level to enable the secret puppy.</li></ul><br><strong>Make your own music!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "Another Hidden Orchestra will be on tour!  The puppies are clumsy, but they are musical!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/98be29f8fd60122fc17f63da219681a7.poster.avif?t=1720034505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/98be29f8fd60122fc17f63da219681a7.webm?t=1720034505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/98be29f8fd60122fc17f63da219681a7.mp4?t=1720034505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Shy Dogs Hidden Orchestra is a hidden object game with musical elements. It's a sequel to the game Shy Cats Hidden Orchestra, where each hidden character found unlocks a new musical instrument inside each game's level. Thus, you'll be able to create your own songs as you find cute little dogs hidden by beautiful 2D cartoon backgrounds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/f0a90c0b27bfcc58d52ac5e17431ce5c.poster.avif?t=1720034505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/f0a90c0b27bfcc58d52ac5e17431ce5c.webm?t=1720034505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509550/extras/f0a90c0b27bfcc58d52ac5e17431ce5c.mp4?t=1720034505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore ten more new levels in cartoon style.<br></li><li> Build ten new songs composed exclusively for the game.<br></li><li> Find over 200 hidden shy puppies and special hints.<br></li><li> Solve a riddle in each level to enable the secret puppy.</li></ul><br><strong>Make your own music!</strong>",
